{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"db694b4651059d610e15470d19fdc3a5f25c2e3741cb6070fdfb8f78c8a16af2","ja":"思い出が足りない！","zh":"回忆还不够！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"58761eed2a0659ef37e6fbb398552eed6b7583c71f5c067d42cdab6244705d5b","ja":"まだまだ遊び足りん！\nそうは思わへん？　みんな！！","zh":"还没玩够呢！\n大家是不是也这么觉得？！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d09f5739a455ffa86543779c0de40b2e6dcb2c5138b9b80ba5759788f95aaaf5","ja":"え～っと～……、\nいきなりどうしたのさ、奈緒？","zh":"那个～……\n突然怎么了啊，奈绪？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cf8f8f57a3e35a3b5f5dc2775926a140579a441d20370fe18d14d08c290569ed","ja":"第五幕の公演が終わってから、このメンバーだけで\n何かする機会って、少なくなってもうたやん？","zh":"第五幕的演出结束之后，就只有这几个成员\n一起做点什么的机会，不是变少了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2031dae635ac39fce196ae7246865c8902e56db84a4d3697838cc1837425f8ad","ja":"しゃーないのはわかってるけど……\n私はまだまだ、思い出作りがしたーい！","zh":"虽然知道是没办法的事……\n但我还想创造更多更多美好的回忆嘛——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"146881612428a70985610e58acefbb4620f4069b2137a7cd1f6ed322bcedb95a","ja":"なるほど～。もう終わりだと思うと、\n寂しくなってしまうものですからな～。","zh":"原来如此～。一想到要结束了，\n难免会觉得有点舍不得呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a14cf83c7a43b4f4b0802fc0970bb1e9bfd4be1d396c13176564426ba31c0625","ja":"つまり……奈緒さんは、\n杏奈達と……遊び足りないって、こと……？","zh":"也就是说……奈绪姐，\n觉得和杏奈她们……还没玩够，是吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4b358d2ea9e8431c970064400f9a59f1ca9e692c3fb0e40695237c9c81395f62","ja":"ストレートに言うと、そう！","zh":"直白地说，就是这样！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8d4b8c5e3ecff0e21cdbd0f08e4c4275a5b9dbc1976cf31f0980ccdc4492b239","ja":"なーんだ、それならオッケーだよ！\nそれで奈緒、何をするかは、もう決めてるの？","zh":"什么嘛，要是那样就没问题啦！\n所以奈绪，你已经决定好要做什么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"cc774c9f6d5b085e46a72b2aa61a9b0bf9c231cb0337d2d24e2af9b0088fb673","ja":"もちろん！　大勢で集まって楽しくやれること、\nといえば……タコパに決まりやんな♪","zh":"当然啦！说到大家聚在一起开开心心能做的事，\n肯定非章鱼烧派对莫属啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"ff6cc24d5bf03e533d6b778f6184ca1d9b0fa58a56e931b8422f6fccfb8f49cb","ja":"そして、数時間後……","zh":"接着，几小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"2defedd3e42428b50c4d7df594341b55fd79199f789922dc8046879ac6e7c329","ja":"たこ焼き機に、生地に、具材にトッピング……。\nよしっ、準備はばっちりです！","zh":"章鱼烧机、面糊、馅料还有配料……\n好嘞，准备得十分充分！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"e37c27411f96c04a4157d20760ef315984221d406f5c80f827e6122564bd0b0e","ja":"ではただいまより、第五幕メンバーによる\nたこ焼きパーティー開催を宣言します♪","zh":"那么现在我宣布，由第五幕成员带来的\n章鱼烧派对正式开始♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"b8034d37e8ec27f9a61e25f548bc307f10ec0b3cae2d5e45a0604cb5c88a24ba","ja":"わー。パチパチパチパチ～♪","zh":"哇——啪啪啪啪～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1463.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"b9f302ca95da7cb2083cdead14207705dd7c77a91c3db3ddf87e237c96f5ad0f","ja":"材料はいっぱい用意しといたから、\n好きなだけ焼いてくれてええからな！","zh":"材料准备得可充分了，\n想烤多少就烤多少吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
